OL,3,GNEWSA#4.5m leisure facilities 'crucial'
OL,4,Afor town
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a #4.5m upgrade of a town's
OL,7,Fleisure facilities - including a new
OL,8,Fcafe, soft-play area and a synthetic 3G
OL,9,Ffootball pitch - are set to move
OL,10,Fforward.
OL,12,FSenior members of South Norfolk
OL,13,FDistrict Council are expected to
OL,14,Fapprove the proposals for Kett's Park
OL,15,Fin Wymondham next week.
OL,17,FKim Carsok, a Conservative who is the
OL,18,Fauthority's deputy leader, said it was
OL,19,F"absolutely crucial to have good
OL,20,Ffacilities" in a town with a growing
OL,21,Fpopulation.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
