OL,3,GNEWSA#4.5m leisure facilities 'crucial'
OL,4,Afor town
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the council was planning to
OL,7,Fspend up to #2.7m on the project, with
OL,8,Ffunding also expected from the Greater
OL,9,FNorwich Growth Board (GNGB) and the
OL,10,FFootball Foundation.
